      "text": "1. teleprompter \n    plain script\n2. excalidraw/diagrams\n    ask for ishween's generated\n    and add claude generated\n3. newsletter \n    organized in structure\n4. Launch post \n    organized in structure\n5. Subsequent linkedin posts\n\n6. Youtube title(3 options) - \n            based on-demand words\n   youtube description w/ time and title - \n            will fill time later after recording\n    tags - to get right audience\n    youtube thumbnail overlay text(3 options)\n       ",
