      "text": "1. data driven \n - hook starts with data example: \n    \"we have 34K emotions ....\"\n - 3 posts with this angle \n\n2. case study per post \n - case study/production example explored in \n    the script\n - hook - start with the failure of production \n    or why in production\n - 1 post per case study\n\n3. problems - solution \n - problem that this video solve - solution (how \n   in 1 line or key takeaways like production \n      example included\"\n - 3 posts with this angle\n\n4. FOMO takeaways angle\n  - biggest takeaways - 1 takeaways is a hook\n   - as many posts as takeaways present ",
